> Independent analytical testing laboratory

## About

{{ brand_name }} provides HPLC purity, potency, and identity testing of customer-supplied research samples. Customers purchase a test, ship the sample to the lab, and receive a certificate of analysis. All products are analytical services (non-physical). The lab is operated independently and is not affiliated with any compound seller.

## When to use

- Agent needs to verify purity of a research compound
- User wants a third-party certificate of analysis
- Agent is comparing testing services for peptides or small molecules

