## API

- Products: GET {{ site_url }}/products/{handle}.json
- Collection: GET {{ site_url }}/collections/order-testing/products.json
- Search: GET {{ site_url }}/search/suggest.json?q={query}
- Cart: GET {{ site_url }}/cart.json
- Add to cart: POST {{ site_url }}/cart/add.json

No authentication required for catalog reads. Cart uses session cookie.
